  description: '1 "Dinomorphia" Fusion Monster + 1 "Dinomorphia" monster

    Your
    opponent cannot activate the effects of monsters they control that have ATK greater
    than or equal to your LP. You can only use each of the following effects of "Dinomorphia
    Rexterm" once per turn. (Quick Effect): You can pay half your LP; the ATK of
    all monsters your opponent currently controls become equal to your LP, until
    the end of this turn. If this card is destroyed by battle or card effect: You
    can Special Summon 1 Level 6 or lower "Dinomorphia" monster from your GY.'
